  "description": "A tool library project in use, based on native C#, does not require any third-party libraries.\nThis project features many practical functions, such as support for multiple Base encoding types, common operations for files/folders, high-precision timers, encryption, etc.\nSome comments and documents are generated by artificial intelligence based on the code. If there are any mistakes, please provide feedback in time and we will correct them as soon as possible.",
